RCCA Workflow Package
=====================

This repository's new product code under `rcca_workflow/` and `gui/` is developed
independently of the ICET-SQS GUI fork.

`legacy_icet_sqs/` retains the previous Streamlit ICET-SQS application (MIT),
originally by Miroslav Lebeda / IMPLANT Team (CTU Prague). See
`legacy_icet_sqs/LICENSE`.

`ex_scripts/` holds frozen method examples (SQS / Metropolis / vacancy / SIA)
used as the scientific source of truth for porting. They are not the ICET-SQS
GUI product.

Any SQS helper code copied from the ICET-SQS lineage into this package must
retain MIT attribution as required by that license.
